   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"7\">\n  <li><strong>Select two</strong> equations whose graphs have a positive <span data-math=\"y\">y</span>-intercept.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol type=\"a\">\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=x^2+3x-2\">f(x)=x^2+3x-2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=x^2-10x\">f(x)=x^2-10x</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=(x-1)^2\">f(x)=(x-1)^2</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=5x^2-3x-5\">f(x)=5x^2-3x-5</span></li>\n  <li><span data-math=\"f(x)=(x+1)(x+2)\">f(x)=(x+1)(x+2)</span></li>\n</ol>",
